    <string name="map_privacy_message">Your Timeline file is never uploaded.\n\nTo draw the map, Timeline Visualizer sends CARTO the tile coordinates for areas in your Timeline, together with normal network information such as your IP address and user agent. This may reveal places in your Timeline to CARTO. The Journey, titles, and videos are not uploaded to CARTO or the developer.</string>
